### Product - Get All Products (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Product - Search Products (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search?q=laptop&category=electronics&minPrice=100&maxPrice=1000

### Product - Get Products by Category (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/category/electronics

### Product - Get Product by ID (Public)
# First create a product, then use its ID here
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_PRODUCT_ID

### Product - Create Product (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Gaming Laptop",
    "description": "High-performance gaming laptop with RTX 4070",
    "price": 1299.99,
    "category": "electronics",
    "stock": 15,
    "sku": "LAPTOP-001",
    "tags": ["gaming", "laptop", "electronics"],
    "specifications": {
        "processor": "Intel i7",
        "ram": "16GB",
        "storage": "512GB SSD"
    }
}

### Product - Get My Products (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/user/my-products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Product - Get Product Statistics (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/user/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Product - Update Product (Protected)
# Replace with actual product ID from create response
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Updated Gaming Laptop Pro",
    "price": 1399.99,
    "stock": 10,
    "description": "Updated description for the gaming laptop"
}

### Product - Update Stock (Protected)
# Replace with actual product ID
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_PRODUCT_ID/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "stock": 25,
    "operation": "set"
}

### Product - Delete Product (Protected)
# Replace with actual product ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Product - Restore Product (Protected)
# Replace with actual product ID of deleted product
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_PRODUCT_ID/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Product - Advanced Search with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search?q=laptop&category=electronics&minPrice=500&maxPrice=2000&page=1&limit=5&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc